<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ABN AMRO NV.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ABN AMRO NV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co CV has issued 750,000 American-style call warrants, on ABN AMRO Holding NV, lead manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    135.00 NLG		PREMIUM	9.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     13.30 NLG		 GEARING	10.15 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	11.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  135.00 NLG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
